            "heading": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Validation and provenance"
              }
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Each representation's geometry, version, and source relation were re-queried directly against the pinned release Parquet asset at publication time and cross-checked against the governed assertion records; this page does not independently verify Overture's underlying geometry, which derives from the governed OpenStreetMap relations. For independent cross-source verification of these representations, see "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "link",
                    "href": "https://knoedg.nyc/nyc-boundaries/",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "NYC Boundaries"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "strong",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Disclosed correction: "
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "at publication time, ten of the eleven representations returned "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "code",
                    "text": "is_territorial=true"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " where this collection's original governed capture had recorded "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "code",
                    "text": "false"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " (only Richmond County's land representation returned "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "code",
                    "text": "false"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "). Geometry, version, and OSM source relation all matched the original capture exactly. A follow-up root-cause investigation — an unchanged release-asset checksum, a reproducible duplicate-free query, and a 99.6% true base rate across the full release — concluded this was an error in the original governed capture, not a live Overture data change. The governed source's prose disposition was corrected accordingly, and the corrected values (shown in the table above) are what this page publishes."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
