                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Scope"
                      }
                    ],
                    "description": [
                      {
                        "type": "text",
                        "text": "Overture's own published division_area representations, each mapped to an already-governed OpenStreetMap relation version — not an independent recomputation. Confidence is High because identity, version, and geometry re-query are stable and precisely versioned, even though the representations remain in the OpenStreetMap provenance cluster rather than counting as independent corroboration."
                      }
