          {
            "type": "section",
            "id": "limitations",
            "heading": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Limitations"
              }
            ],
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The eleven governed representations are the exact versions re-queried against release "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "code",
                    "text": "2026-07-22.0"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " at publication time, not a live feed. Each representation derives from an already-governed OpenStreetMap relation — the same provenance cluster, not independent corroboration. No numeric area is published in Overture's own metadata. This page presents Overture's own published values, including the disclosed is_territorial correction described above; it is not the place to compare Overture against other sources — that comparison lives on "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "link",
                    "href": "https://knoedg.nyc/nyc-boundaries/",
